<#a070f0>GADGET BELT</>
Throw the equipped gadget		^X
  Five gadgets, each with its own cooldown instead of a meter
  cost. Cooldown bars sit at the bottom of the screen: filling
  = cooling down, full = ready, flashing + bright icon = equipped.
  Ground: also cancels a normal on contact.
Next gadget		_D^X
Previous gadget		_U^X
  1 Batarang (45 ticks)	2 Bat Bomb (2.5 s)	3 Grapple Hook (1.7 s)
  4 Smoke Bomb (5 s)	5 Wayne Tech bat swarm (10 s)
  Wayne Tech: with it equipped, X again sends the bats in.
  The Batarang, Grapple and Bat Bomb specials share their
  gadget's cooldown. Air: Batarang, Bat Bomb, Grapple Hook.

<#a070f0>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
Back Throw		_B^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Evade Forward / Back		_F^A_+^B / _B^A_+^B
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U
Wall Cling		(in the air, hold _F at the screen edge)

<#a070f0>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Forward Medium		_F^B
Crouching Light / Medium		_D^A / _D^B
Launcher		_D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Run Attack		_F_F, then ^C
  Normals chain light > medium > heavy, and each one can only
  be used once per combo.

<#a070f0>SPECIALS</>
  The C version is the EX (500 meter) where it says EX.
Batarang (air too)		_B_F^A / ^B / ^C
  The C version is the EX Batarang, 500 meter.
Straight Grapple		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Grapple Swing (EX, 500 meter)		_D_DF_F^C
Air Grapple		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Dark Knight Combo		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  Press A / B / C again for the follow-ups; the second
  follow-up is the Smoke Bomb.
Scattered Bombs (air)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Dark Knight Strike		_D_D^A / ^B
Dark Knight Strike (EX, 500 meter)		_D_D^C
Cape Counter		_B^C

<#a070f0>SUPERS</>
Bat Grapple (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Bat Swarm (1 bar)		_B_F_B_F^A / ^B / ^C
Dark Knight (3 bars)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^X
  Any two of A/B/C work as well.
Valley of Crime (3 bars)		_F_D_B_F_D_B^X
  Any two of A/B/C work as well.
